{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Store User Microservice API",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "User Profile Management, Account Lifecycle, and In-App Notifications Service.\nPowered by Go (Chi router), PostgreSQL (Supabase), Prisma Client Go, gRPC (Order Service Check), Apache Kafka Domain Events, and Redis Sliding-Window Rate Limiting.\n\n### Authentication & Identity Propagation\nAuthentication is performed at the API Gateway perimeter (`store_gateway`). Upon verifying valid JWT bearer credentials, the gateway injects verified headers:\n- `X-User-Id`: Authenticated User UUID (e.g. `9b1deb4d-3b7d-4bad-9bdd-2b0d7b3dcb6d`).\n- `X-User-Role`: User permission role (`customer`, `admin`).\n- `X-User-Email`: Registered email address.\n\n### Lifecycle Coordination (Account Deletion)\nWhen a customer deletes their account via `DELETE /api/users/account`:\n1. **Synchronous Pre-flight Check**: Queries `store_order` over gRPC (`OrderService.CheckActiveOrders`). If active orders exist in states `PENDING_PAYMENT`, `PAID`, `PROCESSING`, or `SHIPPED`, the deletion is blocked and returns `409 Conflict`.\n2. **Hard Deletion**: Permanently purges the user's profile record from PostgreSQL.\n3. **Asynchronous Broadcast**: Dispatches a `user.deleted` domain event to Kafka topic `user.events` for `store_auth` to blacklist tokens and delete login credentials.\n\n### Rate Limiting & Resilience\n- Profile read (`GET /api/users/profile`): 60 requests per minute.\n- Profile write (`PUT /api/users/profile`): 15 requests per minute.\n- Account delete (`DELETE /api/users/account`): 3 requests per minute.\n- Notification feed read (`GET /api/users/notifications`): 60 requests per minute.\n- Notification read-status mutation & deletion: 30 requests per minute.\n- Notification preferences read (`GET /api/users/notifications/preferences`): 60 requests per minute.\n- Notification preferences update (`PUT /api/users/notifications/preferences`): 30 requests per minute.\n- Redis sliding-window counters with fail-open fallback.\n"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "http://localhost:8082",
      "description": "Local User Service Direct"
    },
    {
      "url": "http://localhost:80",
      "description": "API Gateway Ingress"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "User Profile",
      "description": "Personal profile details retrieval and updates"
    },
    {
      "name": "Account Lifecycle",
      "description": "Critical lifecycle operations including account deletion"
    },
    {
      "name": "Notifications",
      "description": "In-app notification feed, read-state toggles, and deletion"
    },
    {
      "name": "Notification Preferences",
      "description": "User channel preferences (email, push, SMS, promotions)"
    },
    {
      "name": "Documentation",
      "description": "Interactive Swagger UI and OpenAPI schema definitions"
    },
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "description": "Readiness and liveness service health probes"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/health": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Health"
        ],
        "summary": "Health Check",
        "description": "Returns liveness status of the store_user service.",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Service is healthy.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HealthResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/docs": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Documentation"
        ],
        "summary": "Interactive Swagger UI",
        "description": "Renders the Swagger UI interactive API documentation portal.",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Swagger UI HTML page.",
            "content": {
              "text/html": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/swagger": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Documentation"
        ],
        "summary": "Interactive Swagger UI Alias",
        "description": "Alias route for the Swagger UI documentation page.",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Swagger UI HTML page.",
            "content": {
              "text/html": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/docs/openapi.yaml": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Documentation"
        ],
        "summary": "OpenAPI Specification (YAML)",
        "description": "Serves the complete OpenAPI 3.1 schema definition in YAML format.",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "OpenAPI 3.1 YAML document.",
            "content": {
              "application/x-yaml": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/docs/openapi.json": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Documentation"
        ],
        "summary": "OpenAPI Specification (JSON)",
        "description": "Serves the complete OpenAPI 3.1 schema definition in JSON format.",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "OpenAPI 3.1 JSON document.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/users/profile": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "User Profile"
        ],
        "summary": "Get User Profile",
        "description": "Retrieves the personal profile details of the authenticated caller identified by the X-User-Id header. Auto-creates a default baseline profile if first access.",
        "security": [
          {
            "GatewayUserIdAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "User profile retrieved successfully.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UserProfile"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalServerError"
          }
        }
      },
      "put": {
        "tags": [
          "User Profile"
        ],
        "summary": "Update User Profile",
        "description": "Updates mutable profile attributes for the authenticated user. Automatically sanitizes text fields to prevent XSS.",
        "security": [
          {
            "GatewayUserIdAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UpdateProfileRequest"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "User profile updated successfully.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UserProfile"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalServerError"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/users/account": {
      "delete": {
        "tags": [
          "Account Lifecycle"
        ],
        "summary": "Delete User Account",
        "description": "Executes a hard deletion of the user's account and profile data.\nPerforms synchronous gRPC pre-flight checks against `store_order` to prevent deletion if active orders exist (`PENDING_PAYMENT`, `PAID`, `PROCESSING`, `SHIPPED`).\nOn success, broadcasts a `user.deleted` event on Kafka topic `user.events`.\n",
        "security": [
          {
            "GatewayUserIdAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": false,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DeleteAccountRequest"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Account successfully deleted.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DeleteAccountSuccessResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "Account deletion blocked due to active orders in flight.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ActiveOrderConflictResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"
          },
          "503": {
            "description": "Order verification gRPC service is unavailable.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalServerError"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/users/notifications": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Notifications"
        ],
        "summary": "List User Notifications",
        "description": "Retrieves a paginated list of in-app notifications for the authenticated user, with optional filter by read status.",
        "security": [
          {
            "GatewayUserIdAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "page",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Page number for pagination (minimum 1)",
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "default": 1
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Number of items per page (maximum 100)",
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "default": 20
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "is_read",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Filter notifications by read status",
            "schema": {
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "List of notifications retrieved successfully.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/NotificationListResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalServerError"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/users/notifications/{id}": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Notifications"
        ],
        "summary": "Get Notification by ID",
        "description": "Retrieves an individual notification item owned by the caller.",
        "security": [
          {
            "GatewayUserIdAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "description": "Notification UUID identifier",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Notification retrieved successfully.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Notification"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalServerError"
          }
        }
      },
      "delete": {
        "tags": [
          "Notifications"
        ],
        "summary": "Delete Notification",
        "description": "Permanently deletes a single notification item owned by the user.",
        "security": [
          {
            "GatewayUserIdAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "description": "Notification UUID identifier",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Notification successfully deleted.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DeleteNotificationSuccessResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalServerError"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/users/notifications/{id}/read": {
      "patch": {
        "tags": [
          "Notifications"
        ],
        "summary": "Mark Notification as Read",
        "description": "Updates the read status of a specific notification and records the read timestamp.",
        "security": [
          {
            "GatewayUserIdAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "description": "Notification UUID identifier",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Notification marked as read successfully.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Notification"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalServerError"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/users/notifications/read-all": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Notifications"
        ],
        "summary": "Mark All Notifications as Read",
        "description": "Marks all unread notifications for the caller as read in a single batch operation.",
        "security": [
          {
            "GatewayUserIdAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "All notifications marked as read successfully.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MarkAllReadResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalServerError"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/users/notifications/preferences": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Notification Preferences"
        ],
        "summary": "Get Notification Preferences",
        "description": "Retrieves communication channel preferences (email, push, SMS, order updates, promotions) for the authenticated user.",
        "security": [
          {
            "GatewayUserIdAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Notification preferences retrieved successfully.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/NotificationPreferences"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalServerError"
          }
        }
      },
      "put": {
        "tags": [
          "Notification Preferences"
        ],
        "summary": "Update Notification Preferences",
        "description": "Updates communication channel preferences for the authenticated user.",
        "security": [
          {
            "GatewayUserIdAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UpdateNotificationPreferencesRequest"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Notification preferences updated successfully.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/NotificationPreferences"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooManyRequests"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalServerError"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "GatewayUserIdAuth": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "X-User-Id",
        "description": "Injected verified User UUID supplied downstream by `store_gateway`."
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "HealthResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "UP"
          },
          "service": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "store_user"
          }
        }
      },
      "UserProfile": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid",
            "example": "a81bc81b-dead-4e5d-abff-90865d1e13b1"
          },
          "userId": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid",
            "example": "9b1deb4d-3b7d-4bad-9bdd-2b0d7b3dcb6d"
          },
          "fullName": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "Budi Pratama"
          },
          "phoneNumber": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true,
            "example": "+628123456789"
          },
          "avatarUrl": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true,
            "example": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-profile.png"
          },
          "bio": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true,
            "example": "Passionate coffee enthusiast & developer."
          },
          "address": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true,
            "example": "Jl. Sudirman No. 45, Jakarta Pusat"
          },
          "gender": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true,
            "enum": [
              "MALE",
              "FEMALE",
              "OTHER",
              "PREFER_NOT_TO_SAY"
            ],
            "example": "MALE"
          },
          "dateOfBirth": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time",
            "nullable": true,
            "example": "1994-08-17T00:00:00Z"
          },
          "createdAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time",
            "example": "2026-08-23T10:00:00Z"
          },
          "updatedAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time",
            "example": "2026-08-23T12:00:00Z"
          }
        }
      },
      "UpdateProfileRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "fullName": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "Budi Pratama Updated"
          },
          "phoneNumber": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "+628123456789"
          },
          "avatarUrl": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-profile-new.png"
          },
          "bio": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "Tech lead & open-source contributor."
          },
          "address": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "Jl. Thamrin No. 10, Jakarta Pusat"
          },
          "gender": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "MALE",
              "FEMALE",
              "OTHER",
              "PREFER_NOT_TO_SAY"
            ],
            "example": "MALE"
          },
          "dateOfBirth": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time",
            "example": "1994-08-17T00:00:00Z"
          }
        }
      },
      "DeleteAccountRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "reason": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "Switching to alternative platform"
          }
        }
      },
      "DeleteAccountSuccessResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "message": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "Account successfully deleted"
          }
        }
      },
      "ActiveOrderSummary": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "orderId": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "ord_99281"
          },
          "orderNumber": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "ORD-2026-99281"
          },
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "ORDER_STATUS_PROCESSING"
          },
          "totalAmount": {
            "type": "integer",
            "example": 185000
          }
        }
      },
      "ActiveOrderConflictResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "cannot delete account: 1 active order(s) in flight"
          },
          "activeOrderCount": {
            "type": "integer",
            "example": 1
          },
          "activeOrders": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ActiveOrderSummary"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "Notification": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid",
            "example": "c41f7142-6e7e-4091-a1b9-7561f7e34ef6"
          },
          "userId": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid",
            "example": "9b1deb4d-3b7d-4bad-9bdd-2b0d7b3dcb6d"
          },
          "title": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "Order Delivered"
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "Your order #ORD-2026-99281 has arrived safely."
          },
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "ORDER_UPDATE"
          },
          "data": {
            "type": "string",
            "nullable": true,
            "example": "{\"orderId\":\"ord_99281\"}"
          },
          "isRead": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "example": false
          },
          "readAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time",
            "nullable": true,
            "example": "2026-08-24T08:30:00Z"
          },
          "createdAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time",
            "example": "2026-08-24T08:00:00Z"
          }
        }
      },
      "NotificationListResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "items": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Notification"
            }
          },
          "totalCount": {
            "type": "integer",
            "example": 15
          },
          "unreadCount": {
            "type": "integer",
            "example": 3
          },
          "page": {
            "type": "integer",
            "example": 1
          },
          "limit": {
            "type": "integer",
            "example": 20
          },
          "totalPages": {
            "type": "integer",
            "example": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "NotificationPreferences": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "userId": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid",
            "example": "9b1deb4d-3b7d-4bad-9bdd-2b0d7b3dcb6d"
          },
          "emailEnabled": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "example": true
          },
          "pushEnabled": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "example": true
          },
          "smsEnabled": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "example": false
          },
          "orderUpdates": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "example": true
          },
          "promotions": {
